{"speciesId":272,"names":{"fr":"Ludicolo","es":"Ludicolo","en":"Ludicolo","ja":"ルンパッパ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"LUDICOLO begins dancing as soon as it hears cheerful, festive music. This POKéMON is said to appear when it hears the singing of children on hiking outings."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"Upon hearing an upbeat and cheerful rhythm, the cells in LUDICOLO’s body become very energetic and active. Even in battle, this POKéMON will exhibit an amazing amount of power."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"When it hears festive music, all the cells in its body become stimulated, and it begins moving in rhythm. It does not quail even when it faces a tough opponent."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"The rhythm of bright, festive music activates LUDICOLO’s cells, making it more powerful."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"The rhythm of bright, festive music activates LUDICOLO’s cells, making it more powerful."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"If it hears festive music, all its muscles fill with energy. It can’t help breaking out into a dance."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"If it hears festive music, all its muscles fill with energy. It can’t help breaking out into a dance."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"If it hears festive music, all its muscles fill with energy. It can’t help breaking out into a dance."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"If it hears festive music, it begins moving in rhythm in order to amplify its power."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"If it hears festive music, it begins moving in rhythm in order to amplify its power."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Ses muscles se tonifient au son d’une musique entraînante. Il ne peut pas s’empêcher de danser."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"If it hears festive music, all its muscles fill with energy. It can’t help breaking out into a dance."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Ses muscles se tonifient au son d’une musique entraînante. Il ne peut pas s’empêcher de danser."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"If it hears festive music, all its muscles fill with energy. It can’t help breaking out into a dance."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"If it hears festive music, all its muscles fill with energy. It can’t help breaking out into a dance."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"If it hears festive music, all its muscles fill with energy. It can’t help breaking out into a dance."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Ses muscles se tonifient au son d’une musique entraînante. Il ne peut pas s’empêcher de danser."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Cuando oye música alegre, sus músculos se llenan de energía, y no puede evitar ponerse a bailar."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"If it hears festive music, all its muscles fill with energy. It can’t help breaking out into a dance."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"陽気な 音楽を 聴くと 体中に 力が みなぎり 踊らずには いられなくなるのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Les cellules de Ludicolo s’activent s’il entend une musique entraînante, le rendant encore plus puissant."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"El ritmo de la música alegre y animada activa las células de Ludicolo y estas le dan fuerza."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"The rhythm of bright, festive music activates Ludicolo’s cells, making it more powerful."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"楽しい 音楽の リズムが ルンパッパの 細胞を 活性化させて パワーを 発揮するのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Ludicolo ne peut pas s’empêcher de danser quand il entend une musique joyeuse et festive. On raconte que ce Pokémon apparaît lorsqu’il entend les enfants chanter pendant leurs randonnées."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Ludicolo empieza a bailar en cuanto oye música alegre y de fiesta. Dicen que este Pokémon aparece cuando oye cantar a los niños que van de excursión para hacer senderismo."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Ludicolo begins dancing as soon as it hears cheerful, festive music. This Pokémon is said to appear when it hears the singing of children on hiking outings."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"陽気な 音楽を 耳にすると 踊り出す。 ハイキングを している 子どもの 合唱に 誘われて 姿を 現すと いわれている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Lorsque Ludicolo entend un rythme entraînant et joyeux, les cellules de son corps s’activent énergiquement. Même pendant les combats, ce Pokémon montre énormément d’énergie."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Las células de Ludicolo se revolucionan y llenan de energía cuando oye sonidos rítmicos y alegres. En combate hace gala también de esta cantidad desmesurada de energía."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Upon hearing an upbeat and cheerful rhythm, the cells in Ludicolo’s body become very energetic and active. Even in battle, this Pokémon will exhibit an amazing amount of power."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"陽気な リズムを 聞くと 体の 細胞が 活発に 活動を 始める 体質。 戦いでも すごい パワーを 発揮するぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Les cellules de Ludicolo s’activent s’il entend une musique entraînante, le rendant encore plus puissant."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"El ritmo de la música alegre estimula sus células y aumenta su fuerza."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"The rhythm of bright, festive music activates Ludicolo’s cells, making it more powerful."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"楽しい 音楽の リズムが ルンパッパの 細胞を 活性化 させて パワーを 発揮するのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il bouge son corps sur un rythme entraînant pour décupler ses forces."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Mover su cuerpo al ritmo de música festiva puede hacer que aumente su fuerza."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"If it hears festive music, it begins moving in rhythm in 